[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2586.15, "timestamp": "00:43:06", "text": "問一些關鍵點。  你知道嗎？ Google Gemini 的總結是基於你的文字稿，是的，它讀取的是你的文字稿，而不是影片本身。聽著，呃，讀著你的視訊文字稿，然後總結一下。然後它會給出相應的時間戳。真"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2605.19, "timestamp": "00:43:25", "text": "不錯。哦，我感覺我也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2611.91, "timestamp": "00:43:31", "text": "可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2613.829, "timestamp": "00:43:33", "text": "複製這個功能，但是如果我換用 Gemini，我現在必須"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2616.63, "timestamp": "00:43:36", "text": "付費才能使用 Gemini Tox。我用的是Gro Q牌的。我用的是Grock牌的，不是G牌的Gritter X Grock。是的，它有免費套餐。  它提供免費套餐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2626.87, "timestamp": "00:43:46", "text": "我想我使用的是羊駝版本。是的。是的。我想，這應該是一個羊駝元"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2635.694, "timestamp": "00:43:55", "author": "@MINKK102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/XVxEYLlWYRuW0CJeu7nHxmdkqt0znzmmZR5ZqaVEYPXxj_o2d9XbeOrr3TLqPPKmPVzsNyU0=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "o7 thumbnail"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2636.87, "timestamp": "00:43:56", "text": "人工智慧"}]